# Scenario "new-game" (milestone 7, native memory card always present): title screen -> New Game -> file 1
# (empty) -> the game creates its save CHIBIROBO(0) and writes the starting data to it -> 3D introduction (first
# dialogue, which waits for A). Replaces the "no memory card" path of intro-no-card, a path that no longer exists.
# Format: tools/scenario.py (times in PRESENTED FRAMES, numbered from 1; no game data here).
# Recorded on GGTP01 with the native card (cycle clock, RTC 800000000, fresh user folder: empty card).
# Expected effect: <user folder>/saves/01-GGTP-CHIBIROBO(0).gci (49,216 bytes) after frame 2900;
# the "load-game" scenario reads it back (same folder: tools/run.py --user-dir).
name new-game
description Title screen, New Game, file 1: creates the save on the native card, then 3D intro.
version GGTP01
window 4

input  150 A       # 60/50 Hz prompt: confirm the 50 Hz option
input 1050 A       # health and safety warning
input 2600 A       # title screen: New Game (empty card: cursor on New Game)
input 2900 A       # New Game file selection screen: file 1 -> save created

check  800 health-warning
check 2000 title-screen
check 2800 new-game-file-select
check 3060 loading soft
check 4000 birthday-dialogue

end 4150
